# sdk/

Rust client SDK for Udex providing idiomatic async APIs over gRPC with built-in TLS channel construction, transparent OAuth2 client-credentials token management, and strongly-typed operation wrappers for all entry and index operations.

## Dirs

- `examples/` -- Runnable examples demonstrating OAuth2 auth, single/batch entry creation, lookups, and client-side envelope encryption
- `src/` -- Core SDK implementation with TLS setup, token management, and entry/index operation wrappers
- `tests/` -- Integration tests covering JWT and OAuth2 flows with embedded server fixtures

## Files

- `README.md` -- Getting started guide with connection patterns, auth configuration, and token refresh examples
- `Cargo.toml` -- Package manifest with workspace settings and tonic/reqwest/thiserror dependencies
